..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : COPY.FREETEXT
.. Author         : fwester
.. Verantwortlich : fwester
.. Kontrolle      : tiwe
.. Functionality  : Copys one freetext into another.
.. An empty source or a not modifiable target breaks copy without an error.
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.continue USAGE ? _F|defined(U|origftext)
.continue USAGE ? _F|defined(U|copyftext)
.continue USAGE ?  F|empty(U|origftext)
.continue USAGE ?  F|empty(U|copyftext)
..
.. Check freetext identifiers
.continue ERROR01 ? _F|defined(.U|origftext)
.continue ERROR02 ? _F|defined(.U|copyftext)
.continue END     ?  F|empty(.U|origftext)
.continue END     ? _F|modifiable(.U|copyftext)
..
.. Declarations
.type integer do       ? _F|defined(U|do)
.type text    formula  ? _F|defined(U|formula)
.type DVMI2   tmpfile  ? _F|defined(U|tmpfile)
..
.. Initializations
.file -tempname U|tmpfile
.atext -language 'G|lsprache' U|formula 3397
.continue FTTMP ? F|fileexists('F|eval(U|origftext)')
..
.. Extract source
.assign U|do = 0
.file -open U|do 'F|eval(U|origftext)'
.continue END ? _G|mehr
..
!FTTMP: Make a deep temporary copy
.input "DATEI.F"
.output new 'U|tmpfile'
.input -text 'F|eval(U|origftext)'
.output terminal
.file -close U|do
..
.. Copy temporary into target using a dynamic command
.'F|formatstr("{1} {2} = {3}{4}{3}", U|formula, U|copyftext, G|dblquote, U|tmpfile)'
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
..*****************************************************************************
!USAGE
.output terminal
Forces a copy from origftext into copyftext.  
origftext = Name of identifier which represents source freetext
copyftext = Name of identifier which represents modifiable target freetext

Both should be defined.
The needed identifier have to be in German (englvar = No).

Named parameters:
=================
Will not be supported!

Array parameters:
=================
Will not be supported!
.continue BREAK
..*****************************************************************************
..
!ERROR01: Missed identifier!
.error -message Der Bezeichner 'U|origftext' wurde nicht gefunden!
.continue USAGE
..
!ERROR02: Missed identifier!
.error -message Der Bezeichner 'U|copyftext' wurde nicht gefunden!
.continue USAGE
..
!BREAK
.end 1
